    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The undead never stop coming\u2026 but neither do you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down relentless hordes of zombies with wild weapons, devastating skills, and game breaking synergies in this fast-paced bullet heaven survival game crafted by a solo dev. Whether playing alone or teaming up in couch co-op, every run is chaotic, challenging, and full of surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Survivors - 60 Skins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 unique heroes</strong>\u00a0and collect\u00a0<strong>over 60 skins</strong> to customize your survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>60+ Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every run based on your game style, you can find anything you want! from critical chance builds, to lifesteal, summoning and more! Combine <strong>28+ passive skills</strong> with powerful synergies to create game-breaking builds and unleash carnage your own way. Every run is different!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Players Couch Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the firepower, double the mayhem! <strong>Team up in local couch co-op</strong> and fight side by side in the ultimate test of survival. Work together to create devastating builds, cover each other\u2019s backs, and see if you can outlast the swarm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique scenarios with their own mechanics, a gripping story on surviving the apocalypse.<strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover 30 unique collectibles that reveal the events leading up to and during the apocalypse. Each one adds a piece to the puzzle of what really happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless <strong>hordes of Zs</strong>, but beware the <strong>Alpha Zs</strong>: <br> <br><strong>Sneaky</strong> \u2013 Silent but deadly. <br><strong>Fatty</strong> \u2013 Slow, but explosive! <br><strong>Fast</strong> \u2013 Quick and relentless. <br><strong>Tanky</strong> \u2013 Tough and hard to take down.  <br><strong>Goliath</strong> \u2013 A force of nature that few can defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras/7eabaeb091f680208c9fe29ff1b5739f.avif?t=1751406626\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The undead never stop coming\u2026 but neither do you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down relentless hordes of zombies with wild weapons, devastating skills, and game breaking synergies in this fast-paced bullet heaven survival game crafted by a solo dev. Whether playing alone or teaming up in couch co-op, every run is chaotic, challenging, and full of surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Survivors - 60 Skins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 unique heroes</strong>\u00a0and collect\u00a0<strong>over 60 skins</strong> to customize your survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>60+ Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every run based on your game style, you can find anything you want! from critical chance builds, to lifesteal, summoning and more! Combine <strong>28+ passive skills</strong> with powerful synergies to create game-breaking builds and unleash carnage your own way. Every run is different!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Players Couch Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the firepower, double the mayhem! <strong>Team up in local couch co-op</strong> and fight side by side in the ultimate test of survival. Work together to create devastating builds, cover each other\u2019s backs, and see if you can outlast the swarm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique scenarios with their own mechanics, a gripping story on surviving the apocalypse.<strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover 30 unique collectibles that reveal the events leading up to and during the apocalypse. Each one adds a piece to the puzzle of what really happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless <strong>hordes of Zs</strong>, but beware the <strong>Alpha Zs</strong>: <br> <br><strong>Sneaky</strong> \u2013 Silent but deadly. <br><strong>Fatty</strong> \u2013 Slow, but explosive! <br><strong>Fast</strong> \u2013 Quick and relentless. <br><strong>Tanky</strong> \u2013 Tough and hard to take down.  <br><strong>Goliath</strong> \u2013 A force of nature that few can defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras/7eabaeb091f680208c9fe29ff1b5739f.avif?t=1751406626\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p>",
